      "value": "Videos on quest are still working fine for me. However, your link doesn't work for me. I did however reupload your video to my server and now it works on quest for me. At first I thought it was the URL length, or the url encoded space which used to cause issues with video players in the past, but they both worked fine. Perhaps a regression with non standard ports since you're using port 5080? \nMy link that works: https://cdn.nyanpa.su/vrc/Ekoroshia.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null
